-spot-dali-chongsheng-three-pagodas", "https://www.visityunnanchina.com/plan-your-trip/travel-blog/exploring-yunnans-5a-lever-scenic-spot-dali-chongsheng-three-pagodas", "https://www.icefestivalharbin.com/photo-p241-3758-three-pagodas-of-chongsheng-temple.html", "https://www.westchinago.com/the-chongsheng-temple-and-the-three-pagoda", "https://www.icefestivalharbin.com/photo-p241-3761-three-pagodas-of-chongsheng-temple.html", "https://www.chinaxiantour.com/dali-attractions/the-three-pagodas.html"], "sources": ["https://www.travelchinaguide.com/attraction/yunnan/dali/three_pagoda.htm", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Pagodas"], "note": "사진 검색: bing", "fee": {"amount": 75, "currency": "CNY", "free": false, "text": "입장료 75 CNY (삼탑문화풍경구 및 숭성사 통합권)", "krw": 15024}, "transport": {"how": "대리고성 북문에서 도보 15분 또는 19번 버스/삼탑 전용버스 탑승 (약 5~10분)", "cost": {"amount": 2, "currency": "CNY"}, "krw": 401}, "duration_min": 150, "hours": "07:30-18:30 (동절기)", "closed": "연중무휴", "category_std": "temple"}, {"id": "dali-erhai-lake", "seg": "dali", "city": "다리", "cat": "자연", "name": "얼하이 호수(생태회랑)", "local": "Erhai Lake / 洱海", "desc": "해발 1,972m 고원에 자리한 귀 모양의 윈난 2대 담수호이다. 서쪽 호숫가를 따라 자동차 진입이 금지된 46km 길이의 친환경 생태회랑 자전거 전용도로와 산책로가 조성되어 있다.", "tags": ["고원호수", "자전거라이딩", "생태회랑", "일출명소"], "area": "얼하이 서안", "lat": 25.6881, "lng": 100.2294, "photo_query": "Erhai Lake Dali", "photos": ["packs/spots-dali-1/8.jpg", "packs/spots-dali-1/9.jpg", "packs/spots-dali-1/10.jpg", "packs/spots-dali-1/11.jpg"], "photo_src": ["https://chinaexplorertour.com/2026/blog/dali-erhai-lake-visit-guide-must-do-experiences/", "https://www.chinatoptrip.com/erhai-lake.html", "https://www.chinaxiantour.com/dali-attractions/erhai-lake.html", "https://camera-c.de/erhai-see-dali-yunnan-erhai-lake-dali/", "https://en.people.cn/n3/2025/0905/c90000-20362866-5.html", "https://chinaexplorertour.com/2026/blog/dali-erhai-lake-visit-guide-must-do-experiences/"], "sources": ["https://www.travelchinaguide.com/attraction/yunnan/dali/erhai_lak